OL,3,GNEWSACity becomes hub for booming
OL,4,AEsports industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former car showroom has been
OL,7,Ftransformed into a multimillion-pound
OL,8,FEsports arena.
OL,10,FThe 15,000 sq ft (1.4 sq m) venue in
OL,11,FSunderland, which has opened alongside
OL,12,Fthe National Esports Performance
OL,13,FCampus, is designed to host major, live
OL,14,Fcompetitions and provide training and
OL,15,Feducation facilities for players and
OL,16,Findustry professionals.
OL,18,FEsports involves competitive video
OL,19,Fgaming, with tournaments attracting
OL,20,Fmillions of players and spectators as
OL,21,Fwell as offering prize money of
OL,22,Fmillions of pounds.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
