OL,3,GNEWSACity becomes hub for booming
OL,4,AEsports industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Esports, the national esports
OL,7,Ffederation for the UK, said the
OL,8,Ffacility was the first of its kind in
OL,9,FEurope and was going to be "a huge
OL,10,Fshowcase of what the UK can do".
